{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"一、二十有六年，春王正月己未，公會莒子、衞甯遬，盟于向。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"二、齊人侵我西鄙。公追齊師至雟，弗及。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"其言至雟弗及何？侈也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"三、夏，齊人伐我北鄙。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"四、衞人伐齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"五、公子遂如楚乞師。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"乞師者何？卑辭也。曷為以外內同若辭？重師也。曷為重師？師出不正反，戰不正勝也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"六、秋，楚人滅隗，以隗子歸。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"七、冬，楚人伐宋，圍緡。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"邑不言圍，此其言圍何？刺道用師也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"八、公以楚師伐齊，取穀。公至自伐齊。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_89_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_89","textTraditional":"此已取穀矣，何以致伐？未得乎取穀也。曷為未得乎取穀？曰：「患之起，必自此始也。」","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}